# The Agents page holds six tiles (Boss, 2026-10-24: "we can only fit six panels on that page, so we should
# prioritize the active sessions … and then … by the most recent"). Requests for Boss outrank work (2026-10-29). The ranking, the six and the order are unit
# tested (AgentTilesTest); staging seven live sessions with one at work needs his own Macs, so this is the look.
[phone] With six or more sessions on the Agents page, start work in one that has no tile: its tile comes onto the page, top left, and the session that last worked longest ago leaves it.
[phone] With several at work, those at work fill the top of the page and the resting ones follow, newest first; while they work they keep their places (no tiles trading places every minute).
[phone] When nothing is at work, the page reads newest first, top left to bottom right.
[phone] A session tile carried to another page stays there and is not counted among the six.

# Fictional older requests outrank newer working sessions, through the production shared tab/list ranking.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez rankedSessions true
tap Show the tabs
expect Approval first
expect Question second
expect Newer working
shot needs-boss-first-strip-cover
# Across the strip itself, by its place: a tab's name also labels its square in the header, and with more tabs than fit
# New chat lies past the screen's edge until the strip has moved.
swipe 0.85 0.21 0.05 0.21 500
swipe 0.85 0.21 0.05 0.21 500
tap All chats
expect Search chats
expect NEEDS YOU
expect AT WORK
shot needs-boss-first-all-chats-cover
key BACK
fold open
rotate landscape
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez rankedSessions true
tap Show the tabs
expect Approval first
expect Question second
expect Newer working
shot needs-boss-first-strip-unfolded
tap All chats
expect Search chats
expect NEEDS YOU
expect AT WORK
shot needs-boss-first-all-chats-unfolded
key BACK
[phone] After promotion: on Agents, an older unanswered approval/question ranks above newer working sessions; multiple unanswered requests rank newest request first. Confirm the same order in strip, All chats and desktop, with the current chat still selected.
